text:
User: I'm using Supabase for auth and Postgres on this project. How do I add row-level security so users only see their own todos?

Assistant:

```sql
alter table todos enable row level security;

create policy users_read_own on todos
for select using (auth.uid() = user_id);

create policy users_insert_own on todos
for insert with check (auth.uid() = user_id);
```

Remember to test with the anon key and a signed-in session.
